What is Zinc Aluminum Flake Coating?
Zinc Aluminum Flake Coating is an advanced anti-corrosion solution composed of zinc (Zn), aluminum (Al), and trace metals like magnesium and silicon. It forms a protective barrier on metal substrates through various application methods, combining zinc's cathodic protection properties with aluminum's barrier effects. The technology offers superior salt spray resistance, weather durability, and self-repairing capabilities compared to traditional coatings.

